<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador Jan-May coffee exports down 32.7 pct-group.</title>
<headline>Ecuador Jan-May coffee exports down 32.7 pct-group.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador exported 269,641 60-kilogram bags of coffee in the first five months of the year, down 32.7 percent from January-May 1996, the National Coffee Exporters Association said Friday.</p>
<p>Income from coffee exports fell 34.17 percent in the period to to $41.9 million, the association said.</p>
<p>((--Franza Bastidas, Quito Newsroom +5932 25-8429))</p>
